# This proxy image (alpine + haproxy + dnsmasq + iptables + runc +
# quickjs-ng + a small Go seccomp-profile generator — see docker/Dockerfile)
# has a small dependency surface. Suppressions here should only be added
# once image-scan.yml has actually flagged a finding against this image and
# the finding has been reviewed as inapplicable — no CVE IDs are
# pre-suppressed by default.

# --- opt/buildcage/bin/runc ---
# Go stdlib/x/net CVEs in runc's statically-linked toolchain. All require a
# TLS/HTTP server or parsing untrusted XML/HTML/DNS — runc here only runs
# locally against a locally-built config.json (docs/security.md). Not reachable.
CVE-2026-56862
CVE-2026-56860
CVE-2026-56859
CVE-2026-56858
CVE-2026-56853
CVE-2026-39821
CVE-2026-33818
CVE-2026-42506
CVE-2026-42502
CVE-2026-27141
CVE-2026-25680
CVE-2026-46600
CVE-2026-33814
CVE-2026-27136
CVE-2026-25681

# github.com/cilium/ebpf: integer overflow parsing a crafted BTF blob in
# LoadCollectionSpec/loadRawSpec. runc here uses this library only to load
# its own bundled cgroup-device BPF programs, never a BTF blob derived from
# external input.
CVE-2026-10722

# --- opt/buildcage/bin/gen-seccomp-profile ---
# Same class of Go stdlib CVEs. This binary (docker/gen-seccomp-profile/main.go)
# takes no input at all — it just prints a hardcoded seccomp profile as JSON.
# Not reachable.
CVE-2026-56862
CVE-2026-56860
CVE-2026-56859
CVE-2026-56858
CVE-2026-46600
CVE-2026-39821
CVE-2026-33818

# --- usr/local/bin/coredns ---
# CoreDNS: DoH/DoQ, forwarding-dependent TXID prediction, and acl/rewrite/
# transfer/loop plugin bugs. The Corefile runs only view+template+log+errors
# on plain UDP/TCP:53 and never forwards; those plugins don't run.
CVE-2023-28452
CVE-2024-0874
CVE-2025-47950
CVE-2025-68151
CVE-2026-26017
CVE-2026-26018
CVE-2026-32934
CVE-2026-32936
CVE-2026-33190
CVE-2026-33489
CVE-2026-35579
GHSA-gv9j-4w24-q7vx

# golang.org/x/crypto/ssh: bugs reachable only by a malicious SSH peer.
# Unused transitive dependency — CoreDNS never opens an SSH connection.
CVE-2026-56854

# golang.org/x/mod: GOPROXY/GOSUMDB sumdb-tile forgery, compromising
# `go build`/`go mod` supply-chain integrity. Same unused dependency —
# CoreDNS is a compiled binary that never runs go tooling.
CVE-2026-56865
CVE-2026-56864

# --- library/isolated-run-universal ---
# OpenSSL: QUIC/CMP/CMS/DTLS/RPK bugs and direct EVP_Cipher() misuse.
# haproxy here only peeks at the raw TLS ClientHello for its SNI (mode tcp,
# req.ssl_sni) — it never completes a handshake or touches those subsystems.
CVE-2026-14456
CVE-2026-14457
CVE-2026-18798
CVE-2026-54874
CVE-2026-63072
CVE-2026-63073
CVE-2026-63074
CVE-2026-63075
CVE-2026-63076
CVE-2026-75803
